<title>INDIA: Indian November vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian November vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles rose in November compared to same month in 1995, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>				   PRODUCTION (in units)</p>
<p>		  Nov 96  Oct 96  Nov 95  Apr-Nov 96   Apr-Nov 95</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	22,230  24,223  22,070    190,834	160,924</p>
<p>  CARS	  31,327  28,786  30,506    253,693	212,324</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 217,288 206,536 237,254  1,995,741    1,706,186</p>
<p>				     SALES (in units)</p>
<p>		  Nov 96  Oct 96  Nov 95   Apr-Nov 96  Apr-Nov 95</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	22,838  22,661  21,189     184,019	156,516</p>
<p>  CARS	  29,027  27,707  29,080     248,508	208,561</p>
<p>  2-WHEELERS 241,809 243,970 239,346   1,961,035    1,705,416</p>
<p>--New Delhi Newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
